&lt;h5 class="smt_head4" style="line-height:18pt;"&gt;③　保有目的が純投資目的である投資株式&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:18pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:ShareholdingsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">大和ハウス工業㈱</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">(保有目的)住宅用防水資材の主要販売先として取引関係維持・強化のため(定量的な保有効果)配当収益他の経済合理性</jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
